    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1728652911319\" id=\"item-6709259e6ba6ca7e1e62ec64\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-video video-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/34418.js&quot;,&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.video\" data-sqsp-block=\"video\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n  <div class=\"intrinsic\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n    <div class=\"embed-block-wrapper\">\n      <div\n        class=\"sqs-native-video\"\n        data-config-settings=\"\"\n        data-config-video=\"{&quot;systemDataSourceType&quot;:&quot;mp4&quot;,&quot;alexandriaUrl&quot;:&quot;https://video.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/13f1608f-46a2-43cb-91bd-b644aee6c3a0/{variant}&quot;,&quot;durationSeconds&quot;:144.0109,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:1.7777777777777777,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;67092cff7562987c757f443a&quot;,&quot;systemDataVariants&quot;:&quot;1920:1080,640:360&quot;,&quot;alexandriaLibraryId&quot;:&quot;66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32&quot;,&quot;audioCodec&quot;:&quot;aac&quot;,&quot;systemDataId&quot;:&quot;13f1608f-46a2-43cb-91bd-b644aee6c3a0&quot;,&quot;videoCodec&quot;:&quot;h264&quot;}\"\n        data-config-loading=\"\"\n        \n      >\n        <div\n          class=\"native-video-player\"\n          style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;\"\n        >\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633 .intrinsic {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-video-block-blend);\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-video-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633 .intrinsic {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n  <style>#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633 { border-width: 0; height: auto; }</style>\n  \n  \n  \n    <style>\n    \n      \n    \n      \n        @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633 { background-color: transparent; }\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_113633 .intrinsic { background-color: var(--tweak-video-block-background-color); }\n        }\n      \n    \n    </style>\n  \n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-8ed72f8e451cddcf26d8\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience the tranquility and elegance of this beautifully designed residence in Niseko, Japan. Situated on a generously sized lot at Lot 2, 50 Heaney Road in Cromwell, this home is a perfect blend of modern convenience and natural beauty, making it an ideal sanctuary for families or as a vacation retreat.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Year Built:</strong> Newly constructed with contemporary design elements and high-quality finishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Land Size:</strong> Expansive, providing ample outdoor space for gardening and recreational activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Floor Size:</strong> Generously proportioned to accommodate spacious living areas, a modern kitchen, and comfortable bedrooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Three well-appointed bedrooms, each offering stunning views of the surrounding landscape and designed for restful nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> One large bathroom featuring modern fixtures and a luxurious bath, providing a spa-like experience at home.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Rooms:</strong> A single, expansive living room with seamless flow to the dining area and kitchen, perfect for entertaining and everyday living.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Interior Highlights:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The kitchen boasts state-of-the-art appliances, a large center island, and stylish brickwork that adds a rustic charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The living room features plush seating, elegant wood furnishings, and large windows that frame the picturesque outdoor views.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bathrooms are designed with marble tiling, offering a clean and bright environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Exterior Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A large covered veranda provides a serene spot to enjoy the outdoors, regardless of the weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The property is surrounded by lush greenery and meticulous landscaping, contributing to its curb appeal and privacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This home is more than just a place to live; it\u2019s a retreat from the fast pace of everyday life. Enjoy the peace and natural beauty of Niseko in this exquisite property, where every detail has been carefully considered for comfort and style.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;670931159abf315abd42cc48&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;670931159abf315abd42cc48&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728650270369_114721\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"67093394b26ecd7dfada5775\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1728656310964-0ZYUMT0XJV02QGNBI1PT/50+Heaney+Road%2C+Cromwell+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%2831%29.jpg\" alt=\"50 Heaney Road, Cromwell Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (31).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1728656310964-0ZYUMT0XJV02QGNBI1PT/50+Heaney+Road%2C+Cromwell+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%2831%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1728656310964-0ZYUMT0XJV02QGNBI1PT/50+Heaney+Road%2C+Cromwell+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%2831%29.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"8640x5760\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"50 Heaney Road, Cromwell Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (31).jpg\" data-load=\"false\" data-image-id=\"67093394b26ecd7dfada5775\" data-type=\"image\" />\n            \n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n      \n        \n          <div class